"show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[S1] 夜雨敲窗，我提灯穿过长廊，忽见一抹黑影立在雕花门畔。\n[S2] 雨声太大，你脚步再轻也逃不过我的耳朵。\n[S1] 你是相府的暗卫？深夜到此，所为何事？\n[S2] 我来取一件旧物，取完便走，不扰佳人清梦。\n[S1] 旧物？这屋里藏的都是我的嫁妆，敢问阁下看中哪一件？\n[S2] 看中了你——劳烦姑娘随我走一趟，有人出价千金买你一笑。\n[S1] 千金买笑？可惜本姑娘不笑，只爱见血。\n[S2] 那便试试，看是你的银针快，还是我的刀更快。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [706.7939453125, 278.6168518066406], "pos": [2054.858642578125, -329.74114990234375], "id": 4, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [13], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [315, 136], "pos": [2438.18310546875, 81.94331359863281], "widgets_values": ["cebc7c1cdd3c858e95d7d07d59c54b8d4d297e2f0f186bf354cfebeb80bd608a.flac", null, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [12], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [315, 136], "pos": [2069.296875, 84.82530212402344], "widgets_values": ["5b146250d760cffaca8be092f4e7c3ccc15a13afca82627b6cc01c405789e0e7.MP3", null, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio